{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：18:37 2026-11-26 HKT<br/>發佈時間：18:37 2026-11-26 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：18:37 2026-11-26 HKT</p><img alt=\"旺角有棚架起火被迅速救熄 疑燒焊意外引致 男工燒傷送院\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/23c591ae36aa773bc3e7be5f2ec35f81/2026-11/collage_86.jpg\"/><p>旺角登打士街近窩打老道一棚架，今日（11月26日）下午5時許起火，消防接報趕至，動用一喉一煙帽隊，迅速將火救熄。經初步調查，疑火警涉及一名50多歲男工燒焊時意外引致，男工燒傷，被送往廣華醫院救治。</p><p>目前案件被列作工業意外跟進。事故期間，窩打老道往九龍塘方向近登打士街部份行車線封閉，交通繁忙。</p><img alt=\"現場為旺角登打士街近窩打老道一棚架。Threads：icyboreddaily\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5d558eaa9a77dcdcbc00eaefe69c139c/2026-11/929220357_18139974868788444_3079723373155248546_n.jpg\"/><img alt=\"現場為旺角登打士街近窩打老道一棚架。Threads：icyboreddaily\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/79332a9e222fa9a6f688d7658bf6377a/2026-11/930378942_18139974835788444_5225698637848080969_n.jpg\"/><img alt=\"消防到場撲救。Threads：icyboreddaily\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5c59d3a6a42b327a4a79ad386793f6c7/2026-11/932368172_18139974799788444_5659228282774978301_n.jpg\"/><img alt=\"消防到場撲救。Threads：icyboreddaily\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/7b71412e8a5ee6edf6aec788654cd442/2026-11/925705174_18139974829788444_4159507085016637053_n.jpg\"/><img alt=\"消防到場撲救。Threads：icyboreddaily\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8fac020a4ab0562c4e71078290a97dc0/2026-11/932191907_18139974781788444_7379434248174237725_n.jpg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-26T11:04:28.702747+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":229,"images":6,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-26T10:37:28+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-26T10:57:41.545256+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-26T10:57:41.545256+00:00","content_hash":"5af0caec98831eceb8ddbd7d98340f5ff9c96a930dd7b398d7e0311f4056ccad","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}